message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Exploring epistasis in human genome-wide data using a two-stage representation-learning framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Arirangan"
    given-names: "Saranya"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Saranya-purdue/epistasis-prioritization-pipeline"
url: "https://github.com/Saranya-purdue/epistasis-prioritization-pipeline"
abstract: >
  Code for a two-stage framework to prioritize epistatic SNP-SNP interactions
  using VAE-based candidate selection, Random Forest with SHAP interaction
  ranking, a 3P evidence rule, and downstream biological follow-up analyses.
keywords:
  - epistasis
  - GWAS
  - SHAP
  - random forest
  - variational autoencoder
  - SNP-SNP interaction
